Subject: [PATCH 2/8] =?utf-8?q?fix(plugin):=20=E7=83=AD=E5=8D=87=E7=BA=A7?=
 =?utf-8?q?=E5=90=8E=E6=81=A2=E5=A4=8D=E5=8E=9F=E5=85=88=E5=90=AF=E7=94=A8?=
 =?utf-8?q?=E7=9A=84=E6=8F=92=E4=BB=B6?=
